{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8EZC13B5R1KH0TJR0CD1Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n このお花を見つけた時\n とっても嬉しい気分になりました〜\n ありがとう♡\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8F09P524PHJG3GEVX28JT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 抱きしめて持ってたらとってもいい匂いがしました♡可愛くて幸せです♡\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8F18AY95TZ72QKK9K6XGN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n お花のメッセージを見て大興奮！\n 私のプチ流行語のうりゃと私の大好きなヒヤロンの文字が入っていて舞い上がってしまいました♡ヒヤロン〜〜\n ヒヤロンは叩くと冷たくなって一気にふあーってなってとっても素敵なアイテムなんですよ！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8F27YDG3JTXDWBEWEG1Z1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n そしてきょんこと同じお花！嬉しい！\n きょんことは隠れ仲良しなのに知っていてくれていた方すごーい！\n 私ときょんこはこっそりとても仲良しなんです♡親友です♡\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8F367924EXX2F5883WSQ1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8F45VWCKV7KHZF4PC48P8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8F58WBD63PBNJFRE3KD68","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8F68TJKBT381ZPK72K2X1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8F76BTPQS9V80JVA7QBJR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8F86DMQBCXFBW7X70ZGG8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n こう見えてツンデレなんですよ〜〜\n こう見えてってどう見えてるのかわかりませんが、実はツンデレで可愛いです。\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8F95ZGVPQD1RP4K0ASQ5V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n そしてドラマでお世話になっているNetflixさんとテレビ東京さんからお花が届いていました！\n \n 嬉しいです！！\n ドラマ楽しみにしていてください！！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n みなさんたくさんのお花ありがとうございました！\n お花を見つけるととっても嬉しくなります！\n 感謝です。\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8FA5C2REK62WEYZ15348R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n いつもありがとう。\n おやすみ。"}],"source":"archive"}